      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Mulliganed a functional 7-card hand with 2 lands, Planar Atlas for mana fixing/ramp, and a solid curve of playable artifacts. While slightly land-light, Planar Atlas finds a third land and provides mana itself, making this hand quite keepable.",
