      "better_line": "Keep the 7-card hand. Play Island turn 1, Planar Atlas turn 2 (finding a land), Dutiful Replicator turn 3, Filigree Attendant turn 4. The hand has a clear game plan and Planar Atlas mitigates the land-light concern.",
      "type": "blunder",
